<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 30.3 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 30.3 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 30.29 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 792.46 million rand's worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.  -- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
